sequenceDiagram
  participant Handler
  participant Dispatcher
  participant Driver
  Handler->>Dispatcher: throw
  Note over Dispatcher: wait retries to the 4th plus 15 plus rand 1 to 30 times retries plus 1
  Dispatcher->>Driver: send copy, same id, retries plus 1
  alt Redis or Predis
    Driver->>Driver: ZADD until executeAt
  else RabbitMQ or SQS
    Driver->>Driver: publish now
  end
